sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant NodeA as Node A (Scanner)
    participant Nearby as Google Nearby Connections
    participant NodeB as Node B (Advertiser)

    Note over NodeB: B starts advertising P2P_CLUSTER
    NodeB->>Nearby: startAdvertising(serviceId, P2P_CLUSTER)
    
    Note over NodeA: A enters discovery phase
    NodeA->>Nearby: startDiscovery(serviceId, P2P_CLUSTER)
    Nearby-->>NodeA: onEndpointFound(endpointId, NodeB)

    Note over NodeA: Node A requests link
    NodeA->>Nearby: requestConnection(endpointId)
    Nearby-->>NodeB: onConnectionInitiated(authDigits)
    Nearby-->>NodeA: onConnectionInitiated(authDigits)

    Note over NodeA,NodeB: Auto-accept matching authentication
    NodeA->>Nearby: acceptConnection()
    NodeB->>Nearby: acceptConnection()

    Nearby-->>NodeA: onConnectionResult(STATUS_OK)
    Nearby-->>NodeB: onConnectionResult(STATUS_OK)

    Note over NodeA,NodeB: Direct Link Formed
    NodeA->>NodeA: NeighborTable.updatePeer(NodeB, ROUTABLE)
    NodeB->>NodeB: NeighborTable.updatePeer(NodeA, ROUTABLE)

    Note over NodeA,NodeB: Synchronize Topology & Routes
    NodeA->>NodeB: MeshMessage(TOPOLOGY_SYNC, NodeA CONNECTED, hop=1)
    NodeB->>NodeA: MeshMessage(TOPOLOGY_SYNC, NodeB CONNECTED, hop=1)
    NodeA->>NodeA: RouteTable.updateRoute(NodeB, hops=1, ttl=35s)
    NodeB->>NodeB: RouteTable.updateRoute(NodeA, hops=1, ttl=35s)